label("$P$", P, S);

label("$Q$", Q, dir(0));

label("$R$", R, W);

label("$1$", (O + P)/2, dir(0));

[/asy]

Solution: To solve the problem, we compute the area of regular pentagon $ABCDE$ in two different ways.  First, we can divide regular pentagon $ABCDE$ into five congruent triangles.

[asy]

